    {source?.source_type==="abstract"&&<Notice>Only the retained abstract is available. A missing detail here does not establish absence from the full paper.</Notice>}{(!source||source.source_type==="none")&&<Notice>No inspectable source was retained. Record missing information explicitly; do not infer a value from a citation.</Notice>}
